Recommends: qrencode
Maintainer: Valenius <support@stranto.com>
Homepage: https://www.valenius.com/
Description: WireGuard VPN manager for non-admin users
 Allows regular (non-root) users to connect and disconnect a WireGuard VPN
 managed by an administrator. Includes a system tray applet and a privileged
 daemon that runs as root to manage the tunnel interface.
